  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61271601), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%83%81%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%98-%EB%B3%B8%EC%83%89/3319)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/165665)\n\nNa-jung has an unfinished 'dream'.\n\nIt is to paint as much as you want without worrying about money.\n\nAfter joining a large company with a high salary, I was taking a class at an art academy, and the time to draw the upper body nude came unexpectedly. Na-jung was not unfamiliar with the identity of the model that appeared in front of her.\n\nIt was the day.\n\ntherefore,\n\nwhy… … … … Is the manager out there?\n\nHe was a boss famous for being cool-headed, Han Jeong-woo, team leader. To make matters worse, Na-jung is caught attending class... … … … !\n\nAfter learning about the boss's taste, the company life seemed to be rough.\n\n“I heard you can’t sleep because of my body.”\n\n\"You keep thinking about it.\"\n\nHowever, this man keeps appearing in front of my eyes.\n\nWhat is this man's real face?",
